迎来首个盈利季度。","reportEdition":"2026-05-24","reportKind":"daily"},{"id":"https://aihot.news/items/cmphld9mr0pcfsljwy8xhd1kg","title":"AI 替代入门级工作：科技行业受裁员冲击最重，74% CEO 冻结或缩减招聘","topic":"行业","publishedAt":"2026-05-24T00:00:00.568Z","urls":["https://aihot.news/items/cmphld9mr0pcfsljwy8xhd1kg","https://www.ithome.com/0/954/235.htm"],"articles":[{"id":"cmphld9mr0pcfsljwy8xhd1kg","title":"AI 替代入门级工作：科技行业受裁员冲击最重，74% CEO 冻结或缩减招聘","originalTitle":"","summary":"奥纬咨询研究发现，AI工具正被广泛用于入门级任务，导致企业招聘重心转向高级岗位，年轻人求职难度加大。科技行业受冲击最严重，74%的CEO已冻结或缩减招聘。计划削减初级岗位的比例从17%跃升至43%，而招聘转向中层岗位的比例则升至30%。尽管超90%的企业在部署AI，但多数仍处试点阶段。报告警告，过快裁员或忽视初级人才储备，可能对人才梯队造成长远风险。","reason":"","url":"https://aihot.news/items/cmphld9mr0pcfsljwy8xhd1kg","originalUrl":"https://www.ithome.com/0/954/235.htm","publishedAt":"2026-05-24T00:00:00.568Z","sourcePublishedAt":null,"discoveredAt":null,"datePrecision":"report","sourceId":"aihot-23t2ho","originalSourceName":"IT之家·人工智能","family":"outlet-115kagi","kind":"media","provider":"aihot","category":null,"sectionLabel":"行业动态","selected":false,"contentMode":"licensed-summary","contentType":"news","translationStatus":"original","evidenceRole":"discovery","rights":{"licenseId":"LicenseRef-AIHOT-Written-Permission","permissionId":"aihot-mojing-written-2026-11-04","provider":"aihot","scope":"text-summary","evidenceUrl":"https://aihot.news/items/cmphld9mr0pcfsljwy8xhd1kg","licenseUrl":"https://aihot.news/terms","checkedAt":"2026-11-11T12:49:21.909Z","attribution":"导读来源：AIHOT；原报道权利归原作者","modified":"保留 AIHOT 原摘要，未二次改写"}}],"familyCount":0,"mergeReasons":[],"selectionReasons":[],"provider":"aihot","sourceStates":[{"id":"aihot-23t2ho","name":"IT之家·人工智能","status":"ok","lastSuccessAt":"2026-11-11T12:49:21.909Z"}],"sectionLabel":"行业动态","reportSummary":"奥纬咨询研究发现，AI工具正被广泛用于入门级任务，导致企业招聘重心转向高级岗位，年轻人求职难度加大。科技行业受冲击最严重，74%的CEO已冻结或缩减招聘。计划削减初级岗位的比例从17%跃升至43%，而招聘转向中层岗位的比例则升至30%。尽管超90%的企业在部署AI，但多数仍处试点阶段。报告警告，过快裁员或忽视初级人才储备，可能对人才梯队造成长远风险。","reportEdition":"2026-05-24","reportKind":"daily"},{"id":"https://aihot.new